<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL PRICES NEW ISSUE AT 10 ZLOTYS.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL PRICES NEW ISSUE AT 10 ZLOTYS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Universal SA trading and</p>
<p>					     manufacturing company</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares exchangeable</p>
<p>		  for convertible bonds at 10,000 shares per bond</p>
<p> Priced at (PLN):			10</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 10,000,000</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		23,100,510</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   CBM Pekao SA</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			finance development strategy</p>
<p>			    to 2000, pay off part of short-term debt</p>
<p>Subscription: July 1,1997-November 30, 2001 (bond conversion)</p>
<p>In March Universal SA sold in a private placement 1,000</p>
<p>convertible bonds with a semi-annual 5.5-percent coupon.</p>
<p> Group Earnings Data (mln PLN)  1997 forecast	 1996</p>
